id: sli_si91x_ncp_uart_config
package: platform_siwx91x
description: >
  This component configures the NCP communication interface over USART between the host MCU and the SiWx91x wireless module.

label: NCP Bus USART Configuration
category: Device|Si91x|Wireless|Network Stack
quality: production
metadata:
  sbom:
    license: Zlib
component_root_path: ./components/board/silabs/config
provides:
- name: sli_si91x_ncp_uart_config
